  "description": "After years of hard work, Eun-Tae Gong becomes the youngest team leader at Hong-Seong International, a major luxury brand licensing company. Instead of the success he envisioned, he’s bombarded by office politics and constant pressure. When he unexpectedly wins 1.8 billion won in the lottery, he believes he’s finally found an escape, but family troubles and a brand new outlook on life lead him back to the office where he and his unlikely team of underdogs battle the odds to succeed.\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
